  lines:
  - speakerName: Sparkie
    portrait: {fileID: 10901, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    text: 'We push old machines to the back of the closet, and we walk past the people
      who quietly keep our world running. '
  - speakerName: Sparkie
    portrait: {fileID: 10901, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    text: 'But being overlooked is not the same as being empty. Behind every dusty
      shell and every tired face, an Inner Spark is still waiting. Take the time
      to see it. '
  - speakerName: Sparkie
    portrait: {fileID: 10901, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    text: Thanks for playing!
